Show what changed in a workspace

Usage: forkspace diff [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  Name of the workspace to diff

Options:
      --stat          Show a compact stat summary (files changed, insertions, deletions)
      --full          Show the full unified diff output
      --files         List only the changed file paths
      --cumulative    Include changes from all ancestor layers
      --json          Output diff information as JSON
      --no-gitignore  Show all files including gitignored paths (build artifacts, node_modules, etc.)
  -h, --help          Print help
